B.f7=new A.bp(B.H5,["Explore","Contact","Ye Hongyu","Student","I am a curious student who enjoys learning and exploring new ideas. This site documents my growth, thinking, and future work.","Explore my work","Contact me","Memoji portrait of Ye Hongyu","Personal growth","Turn every lesson into something made.","Coursework, reading, and practice help me build not only knowledge, but my own way of thinking.","Projects","From an idea to reality.","Future individual and team projects will document the process, decisions, and lessons along the way.","Curiosity","Stay curious.","A growing collection of topics, writing, inspiration, and discoveries worth exploring further.","Continuously evolving","Computer Projects","Photography","Code, experiments, and product ideas.","Observations and stories through images.","Learn more","Let\u2019s talk.","If you would like to talk about learning, shared interests, or collaboration, reach me by email or GitHub."],t.li)
